the same "},{"id":"p6s7","text":"prompt across 2–4 models at once with per-model parameter overrides — results are grouped side by si"},{"id":"p6s8","text":"de\n- **Prompt enhancement**: rewrite a rough idea into a ready-to-generate description with an LLM ("},{"id":"p6s9","text":"pick any model from *Settings → Models*; falls back to the agent default model)\n- **History with one"},{"id":"p6s10","text":"-click restore**: prompt, config, model set *and the original audio* come back into the panel — no r"},{"id":"p6s11","text":"egeneration, no extra cost\n- **Resource library**: auto-save generated audio (or opt in per run), or"},{"id":"p6s12","text":"ganized by type — voices / music / SFX / TTS — with search, tags, rename, category moves, and full p"},{"id":"p6s13","text":"rovenance (channel, model, voice id, prompt, params snapshot). Reuse a voice or music bed instead of"},{"id":"p6s14","text":" regenerating\n- **Agent tools**: `generate_audio` and `search_audio_library`, `manage_audio_voices` "},{"id":"p6s15","text":"(vendor voice browsing/deletion + prompt-based voice recommendation + **role voice casting**), plus "},{"id":"p6s16","text":"bundled session skills — the Agent can generate and find audio on demand\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## 📸 Screenshots"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| Generation panel | Resource library |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| Library — full provenance drawer | Channels settings |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| Channel editor (model catalog & auto capabilities) | LLM models (Settings → Models) |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## 📦 Installation"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"The plugin is published on npm. DSH host (Node ≥ 20) required."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Local development install:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Restart `dsh web` after install — the sidebar will show the **AI Audio** entry."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## 🚀 Quick start"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"1. Open **Settings → Plugins → AI Audio**\n2. Add a channel: pick a preset provider (+ Add provider) "},{"id":"p18s2","text":"or a custom endpoint (+ Add custom provider)\n3. Fill in the API URL, API key, and the model/voice ca"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"talog (use *Fetch available models* to import them)\n4. Save, then open the **AI Audio** sidebar pane"},{"id":"p18s4","text":"l:\n- choose a mode (Speech / Music / Sound effects / Voice design)\n- type your text or prompt (optio"},{"id":"p18s5","text":"nal: ✨ Enhance prompt)\n- pick a model — or tick **Model comparison** for 2–4 models at once\n- press "},{"id":"p18s6","text":"**Start generation** and play the results, download them, or add them to the resource library"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## 🎛 Modes supported by each vendor"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| Mode | MiniMax | ElevenLabs | Stability AI | OpenAI-compatible / custom |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| TTS | ✅ (8 voices) | ✅ (voices + streams) | — | ✅ |\n| Music | ✅ (`music-3.0` / `music-2.6` / `musi"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"c-cover`) | ✅ (`music_v2`) | ✅ (`stable-audio-*`) | ✅ (generic POST) |\n| Sound effects | — | ✅ (`ele"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"ven_text_to_sound_v2`, loop / prompt influence / output format as codec+sample rate+bitrate → `outpu"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"t_format`) | ✅ (`stable-audio-*` — same text-to-audio protocol; auto-detected in both Music and SFX)"},{"id":"p21s5","text":" | ✅ (generic POST) |\n| Voice design | ✅ (`/v1/voice_design`) | ✅ (`/v1/text-to-voice/design`) | — |"},{"id":"p21s6","text":" (generic POST) |\n| Voice design | ✅ (`/v1/voice_design`) | ✅ (`/v1/text-to-voice/design`) | — | — |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## 🤖 Agent usage"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"| Tool | Purpose |"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| `generate_audio` | Submit a TTS / music / SFX / voice-design task; waits for completion and return"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"s same-origin audio URLs. Optional `enhance_prompt`, `save_to_library`, per-vendor params. |\n| `mana"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"ge_audio_voices` | Browse/filter the vendor voice libraries (MiniMax, ElevenLabs) with language/keyw"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"ord/source filters; recommend top-k voices for a natural-language requirement (`action=recommend`, u"},{"id":"p24s5","text":"ses the agent default model, ids validated against the pool); **role casting** (`action=cast` prepar"},{"id":"p24s6","text":"es per-character filtered candidate pools from character profiles; `action=save_cast` validates + pe"},{"id":"p24s7","text":"rsists the plan); delete account-owned voices (official/shared/system voices are read-only and refus"},{"id":"p24s8","text":"ed). Then use the returned `voice_id` with `generate_audio` (mode=tts). |\n| `search_audio_library` |"},{"id":"p24s9","text":" Search the local resource library (type / category / keyword) and reuse an existing voice, music be"},{"id":"p24s10","text":"cal resource library (type / category / keyword) and reuse an existing voice, music bed or effect. |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Typical session commands (skills bundled with the plugin):"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## 🔐 Security & data notes"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"- API keys are stored in the local DSH settings document; requests are proxied by the local host (`/"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"api/dsh-audiogen/*`, loopback-only routes)\n- Generation consumes your upstream provider quota; audio"},{"id":"p28s3","text":" content is produced by the upstream model\n- History & library persist under `~/.dsh/dsh-audiogen/`\n"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"- Prompt enhancement calls the LLM model you choose (default: agent default model) — no extra API ke"},{"id":"p28s5","text":" Prompt enhancement calls the LLM model you choose (default: agent default model) — no extra API key"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## 🛠 Development"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## 📄 License"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Apache-2.0"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
